{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05314","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 孙佺","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"应节萸房满，初寒菊圃新。\n龙旗焕辰极，凤驾俨香闉。\n莲井偏宜夏，梅梁更若春。\n一忻陪鴈塔，还似得天身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙佺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}